{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"publication\":{\"ref\":\"DOI:10.21203/rs.3.rs-9617843/v1\",\"title\":\"Subthalamic Signatures of Freezing while Turning in Parkinson’s Disease\",\"publication_status\":\"preprint\",\"version_of_candidate\":null,\"study_id_candidate\":\"possible_follow_up_analysis_of_Klocke_et_al_2024_ref40（待审计确认）\",\"cohort_id_candidate\":\"possible_overlap_with_Klocke_et_al_2024_Brain_cohort_ref40（待审计确认）\",\"cohort_relation_basis\":\"本文Methods明确称当前转弯分析来自一组此前已报告“regular walking期间FoG相关神经异常”的患者，并引用Klocke et al., Brain 2024, DOI:10.1093/brain/awae223（本文参考文献40）。作者团队、Tübingen中心、双侧STN-DBS及步态LFP研究背景一致，提示可能是同一/重叠队列的后续分析；但本PDF未给出患者ID交叉表或明确声明完全相同队列，故仅标possible_overlap，不断言。\",\"source_type\":\"primary\",\"basis\":\"fulltext\",\"fulltext_checked\":true},\"evidence\":[{\"eid_local\":\"E01\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然直立走廊行走中的180°转弯；FoG-Turn为包含视频临床确认FoG的完整转弯周期。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP时频ERSP：转弯周期内低beta去同步化（ERD）\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"低beta 13-20 Hz；Morlet 6 cycles、1 Hz频率分辨率、200 ms滑窗平滑；整段转弯周期插值为1000点；相对站立基线计算ERSP（dB）；总功率归一化范围方法部分为2-98 Hz。\",\"finding\":\"相对于Standing，FoG-Turn全转弯周期缺乏低beta ERD；异常限于低beta，alpha与upper-beta ERD仍保留。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"cluster-based permutation P=0.0002；低beta范围13-20 Hz。没有报告该比较的标准化效应量/CI。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者/半球级频谱分析；5000次cluster-based permutation，cluster-forming alpha=0.05，单侧检验；正文称对subject-level power进行检验。FoG-Turn数据来自11例患者。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"FoG-Turns showed a lack of event-related desynchronization throughout turning, limited to the low beta range (13–20 Hz)\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Low beta band decoupling is impaired in FoG-Turns compared to Reg-Turns\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 2A\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E02\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"每个FoG-Turn起始前3秒的自然步行转弯过渡期；同一转弯随后确实包含临床确认FoG。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP时频ERSP：转弯前低beta ERD\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"低beta；Pre FoG-Turn窗口为turn start前3000 ms；Morlet 6 cycles、1 Hz分辨率、200 ms平滑；ERSP相对Standing（dB），总功率2-98 Hz。\",\"finding\":\"Pre FoG-Turn相对Standing缺乏低beta去同步化；alpha及high-beta去同步化仍保留（high beta P=0.002；alpha P=0.006）。正文未给低beta缺乏ERD本身的独立P值。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"低beta ERD缺失（未给该缺失的单独P值）；high beta cluster P=0.002；alpha cluster P=0.006。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者/半球级时频分析；cluster-based permutation，5000次；Pre FoG-Turn定义为FoG-Turn前3秒。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"we found a lack of low beta band desynchronization in the time-frequency domain in Pre FoG-Turns compared to Standing\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Defective low beta desynchronization may precede FoG-Turns compared to Standing\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 2D\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E03\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然走廊180°转弯；比较FoG实际发生区间（FoG onset至offset）与等时长Reg-Turn片段。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP频域相对功率：FoG期间与无冻结转弯期间低beta功率比较\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"低beta 12-15 Hz；FoG段从冻结start至end；Reg-Turn按患者FoG平均onset/offset截取等长epoch；频域对时间平均。Fig.3图注称归一化到2-89 Hz，方法通用段落称2-98 Hz，存在报告口径差异。\",\"finding\":\"FoG-Turn相较Reg-Turn在12-15 Hz低beta相对功率升高。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"cluster-based permutation P=0.0274；图注报告P=0.027；无效应量/CI。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者级subject-averaged spectra；cluster-based permutation；图3A标注n=11患者。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"FoG-Turn showed increased low beta band activity (12–15 Hz)\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Low beta band decoupling is impaired in FoG-Turns compared to Reg-Turns\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 3A（图注PDF第17页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E04\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然转弯前3秒；Pre FoG-Turn与Pre Reg-Turn直接比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP频域相对功率：转弯前低beta谱差异\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"重点低beta约13-15 Hz；turn start前3000 ms；subject-averaged frequency-domain spectra；相对功率。\",\"finding\":\"Pre FoG-Turn与Pre Reg-Turn频谱直接比较未发现显著差异；Pre FoG-Turn在13-15 Hz数值上较高，但多重比较校正后不显著。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"P>0.05（校正后）；无显著差异。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者级subject-averaged spectra；cluster-based permutation；图3B n=11患者。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"When directly comparing the frequency domain spectra of Pre FoG-Turn and Pre Reg-Turn, however, no differences were found.\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Defective low beta desynchronization may precede FoG-Turns compared to Standing\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 3B（图注PDF第17页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E05\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":null,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。纯运动学结局，n_patients_with_valid_neural_data不适用。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"Pre FoG-Turn与Pre Reg-Turn：turn start前3秒的自然步行过渡期。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"运动学：步长、步速/stride velocity、cadence（非神经信号）\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"L5 IMU；turn start前3秒的步态参数；MobilityLab算法；步长m、stride velocity m/s、cadence steps/min。\",\"finding\":\"Pre FoG-Turn相较Pre Reg-Turn表现为stride length较短、stride velocity较低、cadence较高，作者称为sequence effect。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"Stride length 0.75±0.13 vs 0.83±0.17 m，P=0.037；stride velocity 0.66±0.14 vs 0.70±0.12 m/s，P=0.049；cadence 107.8±21.4 vs 104.3±22.5 steps/min，P=0.037；Wilcoxon signed-rank。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者内配对比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test；具体转弯前epoch数未单列。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"lower stride length in Pre FoG-Turns ... lower stride velocity ... increasing cadence in Pre FoG-Turns compared to Pre Reg-Turns\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Defective low beta desynchronization may precede FoG-Turns compared to Standing\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 1D（图注PDF第15页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E06\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":198,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。n_trials为图注single-trial观测数。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然直立走廊转弯中的FoG-Turn，与Regular Walking直行步态比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP单试次宽带theta平均功率（broadband theta mean power）\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"theta 4-7 Hz；单试次均值；与Regular Walking比较；归一化功率a.u.。\",\"finding\":\"FoG-Turn的宽带theta功率低于Regular Walking。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"FoG-Turn 2.79 [2.49-3.30] vs Regular Walking 2.90 [2.36-3.41] a.u.；P=0.029。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"单试次观测的混合效应模型（结果段称GLME）；图4A FoG-Turn n=198、Walking n=1859个single-trial observations；患者数并非试次数。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"FoG-Turns showed decreased theta activity compared to Regular Walking\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Enhancement and attenuation of theta power across locomotor states\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 4A（图注PDF第17-18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E07\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":198,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。n_trials为图注single-trial观测数。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然直立走廊转弯中的FoG-Turn，与Regular Walking直行步态比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP单试次peak theta power\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"theta 4-7 Hz；每个single trial提取theta频带峰值功率；与Regular Walking比较。\",\"finding\":\"FoG-Turn的peak theta power低于Regular Walking。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"FoG-Turn 3.56 [3.04-4.24] vs Regular Walking 3.96 [3.14-4.96] a.u.；P<0.001。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"单试次混合效应模型；图4B；FoG-Turn n=198、Walking n=1859 single-trial observations。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"jud