th_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":168,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。n_trials为图注single-trial观测数。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"包含FoG的自然转弯（FoG-Turn），与静止站立基线比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP beta burst平均持续时间（mean burst duration）\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"每位患者站立30 s时个体peak beta ±2 Hz；幅度包络200 ms移动平均；burst阈值为站立振幅分布第75百分位，最短burst 100 ms；FoG-Turn单试次平均burst duration。\",\"finding\":\"FoG-Turn的平均beta burst持续时间与Standing相比无显著变化。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"FoG-Turn log-transformed burst duration -0.53 [-0.61,-0.46] vs Standing -0.54 [-0.56,-0.47]；P=0.569；图5A FoG-Turn n=168、Standing n=21 single-trial observations。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者/半球内single-trial均值；LME，患者作为随机效应（截距和斜率）；仅纳入出现FoG-Turn的患者。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"burst durations in FoG-Turns did not change from Standing\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Decoupling failure of pathological beta bursts in FoG-Turns\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 5A（图注PDF第18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E13\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":168,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。n_trials为图注single-trial观测数。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"包含FoG的自然转弯（FoG-Turn），与无冻结Regular Walking比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP beta burst持续时间分布（duration-bin occupancy/proportion）\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"个体peak beta ±2 Hz；阈值为站立振幅第75百分位；burst最短100 ms；持续时间分箱100-200、200-300、300-400、400-500、500-600、>600 ms；比较FoG-Turn与Walking。\",\"finding\":\"FoG-Turn相较Walking出现burst持续时间分布向长时程偏移：0.1-0.3 s短burst比例下降，≥0.4 s长burst比例上升。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"Repeated-measures ANOVA：F(2.003,18.024)=8.455，adjusted P=0.003。相对Walking，100-200 ms -12.95%（P=0.010），200-300 ms -6.96%（P=0.011），400-500 ms +5.20%（P=0.027），500-600 ms +5.21%（P=0.046），>600 ms +4.19%（P=0.048）。图5A的FoG-Turn trial n=168、Walking n=876。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者内重复测量ANOVA，Greenhouse-Geisser校正（报告校正df），Bonferroni事后比较；burst比例按时长分箱。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"distinct shift and hence redistribution from shorter bursts (0.1–0.3 s) towards longer lasting bursts (> 0.4 s)\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Decoupling failure of pathological beta bursts in FoG-Turns\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 5B（图注PDF第18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E14\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":166,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。n_trials为图注single-trial观测数。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"随后发生FoG的转弯前3秒Pre FoG-Turn，与静止站立比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP beta burst平均持续时间\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"个体peak beta ±2 Hz；站立30 s定义峰值及75百分位阈值；最短burst 100 ms；Pre FoG-Turn为turn start前3秒。\",\"finding\":\"Pre FoG-Turn平均beta burst持续时间短于Standing。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"Pre FoG-Turn log-transformed duration -0.59 [-0.68,-0.52] vs Standing -0.54 [-0.56,-0.47]；P=0.010；图5A Pre FoG-Turn n=166、Standing n=21 single-trial observations。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"LME，single-trial mean burst duration为因变量；患者随机截距和斜率；仅纳入出现FoG-Turn者。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"Pre FoG-Turn (P = 0.010) displayed significantly shortened burst durations compared to Standing\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Decoupling failure of pathological beta bursts precedes FoG-Turns\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 5A（图注PDF第18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E15\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":11,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":11,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":166,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。n_trials为图注single-trial观测数。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"随后发生FoG的转弯前3秒Pre FoG-Turn，与Regular Walking比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP beta burst持续时间分布：短burst比例\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"burst持续时间分箱100-200 ms至>600 ms；Pre FoG-Turn窗口为turn start前3000 ms；与Regular Walking比较。\",\"finding\":\"Pre FoG-Turn的100-200 ms短burst比例低于Regular Walking；正文称减少11.09%，图5图注称约10%。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"正文：−11.09% bursts，adjusted P=0.010；图5C图注：−10%，P=0.010；两处数值略有不一致。Pre FoG-Turn n=166 single-trial observations（图5A）；walking n=876。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者内重复测量ANOVA；2-way repeated-measures ANOVA，Greenhouse-Geisser校正；事后比较；仅window 1显著。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"significantly lower proportion of burst durations (−11.09% of bursts, adjusted P = 0.010) in the 100–200 ms interval\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—Decoupling failure of pathological beta bursts precedes FoG-Turns\",\"page\":\"6\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 5C（图注PDF第18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E16\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":null,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":null,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。本条患者级n或模型有效行数全文未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然FoG-Turn与Reg-Turn；在各转弯中关联beta burst持续时间与平均转弯角速度。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP beta burst持续时间与转弯平均角速度的相关\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"个体peak beta ±2 Hz；burst持续时间；L5 IMU平均角速度（°/s）；按转弯事件计算的相关分析（具体分析单位未在正文说明）。\",\"finding\":\"FoG-Turn中burst持续时间与平均角速度呈负相关；Reg-Turn中未见相关。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"FoG-Turn Spearman rho=-0.478，P=0.038；Reg-Turn rho=-0.006，P=0.979。相关样本量/置信区间未报告。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"Spearman rank correlation；正文未明确相关分析的独立统计单位及n（患者汇总、转弯级或半球-转弯级），因此不能判定是否充分处理重复测量。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"not_assessable\",\"reason\":\"非预测证据；模型见E17-E21。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"some_concerns\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"Beta burst duration is negatively correlated with mean angular velocity in FoG-Turns (rho: -0.478, P = 0.038)\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—A binomial logistic regression model to help differentiate FoG from Reg-Turns\",\"page\":\"7\",\"figure_table\":\"Fig. 5D（图注PDF第18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E17\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":null,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":null,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。本条患者级n或模型有效行数全文未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"自然FoG-Turn与Reg-Turn二分类；模型同时纳入转弯期和转弯前的神经/运动学特征。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"多变量binomial GLME：burst duration（Turn/Pre-Turn）、mean angular velocity（Turn）、stride length（Pre-Turn）对FoG-Turn标签的条件关联\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"转弯期burst duration；转弯期mean angular velocity；转弯前burst duration；转弯前stride length；未指定单一频段，burst按个体peak beta ±2 Hz定义。\",\"finding\":\"多变量模型中，转弯期burst duration与FoG-Turn正相关；转弯期平均角速度及转弯前stride length与FoG-Turn负相关；转弯前burst duration未达显著。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"Turn burst duration β=0.709，P=0.001，OR=2.032，95%CI 1.326-3.114；turn mean angular velocity β=-2.668，P<0.001，OR=0.069，95%CI 0.019-0.257；Pre-Turn stride length β=-0.978，P<0.001，OR=0.376，95%CI 0.228-0.619；Pre-Turn burst duration β=-0.317，P=0.091，OR=0.728，95%CI 0.504-1.052；full-model R²=0.476。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"Binomial GLME；Subject为随机效应，最终模型含Subject随机截距及mean angular velocity随机斜率；模型公式及固定效应表见Table 2。模型分析观测行数未单独报告。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"high\",\"reason\":\"n=13（FoG-Turn 11）；仅LOSO内部验证，无外部队列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"high\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"Of these, mean angular velocity during turning showed the strongest negative associations with FoG occurrence\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—A binomial logistic regression model to help differentiate FoG from Reg-Turns\",\"page\":\"7\",\"figure_table\":\"Table 2（PDF第7页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E18\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":null,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":null,\"n_FOG_events\":null,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。本条患者级n或模型有效行数全文未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"during_FOG\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"使用自然FoG-Turn与Reg-Turn数据进行二分类；leave-one-subject-out交叉验证。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"多模态分类性能：STN beta burst duration + 转弯/转弯前运动学特征\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"模型特征：Turn burst duration、Turn mean angular velocity、Pre-Turn burst duration、Pre-Turn stride length；FoG-Turn vs Reg-Turn。\",\"finding\":\"模型区分FoG-Turn与Reg-Turn的平均AUC为0.84±0.14，准确率70±19%，Cohen's kappa 0.34±0.16；阈值>0.50判定FoG-Turn。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"AUC 0.84±0.14；accuracy 70±19%；Cohen's kappa 0.34±0.16；固定效应R²=0.476。模型以受试者为留出单位进行内部LOSO验证。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"Binomial GLME；leave-one-subject-out（每次留一名患者作测试集）；性能按留出患者迭代并平均；模型数据行数/类别数目未单独报告。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"视频/IC-FOG；FoG标签一致性未单列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p4,6\"},{\"domain\":\"信号伪迹\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"ECG/IMU筛查；subject 6/15排除，补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3-4\"},{\"domain\":\"混杂\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"仅MedOFF/StimOff；患者层调整不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p3,6\"},{\"domain\":\"重复测量\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"部分模型有subject随机效应；部分统计单位不明。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6\"},{\"domain\":\"多重比较\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"局部校正已用；总体校正未述。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5\"},{\"domain\":\"过拟合/验证\",\"judgement\":\"high\",\"reason\":\"n=13（FoG-Turn 11）；仅LOSO内部验证，无外部队列。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-6,9\"},{\"domain\":\"选择性报告\",\"judgement\":\"unclear\",\"reason\":\"未说明预注册；补充材料未附。\",\"source_locator\":\"p5-10\"}],\"overall\":\"high\"},\"limitations\":\"小样本单中心、仅MedOFF/StimOff；无皮层记录，网络机制未直接检验。\",\"quote\":\"accuracy 70 ± 19%, AU-ROC: 0.84 ± 0.14\",\"source_locator\":{\"section\":\"Results—A binomial logistic regression model to help differentiate FoG from Reg-Turns\",\"page\":\"7\",\"figure_table\":\"Table 2、Fig. 5F-H（PDF第7及18页）\",\"supplement\":null},\"basis\":\"fulltext\"},{\"eid_local\":\"E19\",\"design\":\"观察性单中心患者内重复测量。\",\"population\":\"PD n=13；均双侧STN-DBS/definite FoG；FoG-Turn 11例/122个含冻结转弯，Reg-Turn 13例/224个转弯。\",\"n_enrolled\":13,\"n_analyzed\":null,\"n_patients_with_FOG\":13,\"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\":null,\"n_FOG_events\":0,\"n_trials\":null,\"n_electrodes_contacts\":null,\"missing_reason\":\"全文未报告独立FoG episode数/有效contact总数；122为含冻结转弯数；补充材料未附。本条trial数未报告。本条患者级n或模型有效行数全文未报告。\",\"endpoint_class\":\"A_actual_natural\",\"event_phase\":\"non_event_gait\",\"freezing_phenotype\":\"未报告FoG亚型；视频临床标注FoG。\",\"medication_phenotype\":\"OFF-FOG：definite FoG在off-assessment临床确认。\",\"experimental_medication_state\":\"MedOFF隔夜停药；具体时长未报告。\",\"DBS_state_and_parameters\":\"双侧STN-DBS/Medtronic Percept；StimOff 20 min；LFP 250 Hz。\",\"task\":\"无冻结Regular Turn前3秒的自然步行过渡期（Pre Reg-Turn），与静止Standing基线比较。\",\"recording_location\":\"双侧STN-LFP；每STN 1双极pair；subject 15左STN频谱排除。\",\"measure\":\"STN-LFP时频ERSP：Pre Reg-Turn期间alpha及beta去同步化\",\"frequency_and_analysis_window\":\"Pre Reg-Turn窗口为turn start前3000 ms；low beta、high beta及alpha；Morlet 6 cycles、1 Hz分辨率、200 ms平滑；ERSP相对Standing（dB）。\",\"finding\":\"Pre Reg-Turn相对于Standing显示alpha、low-beta和high-beta频段去同步化/attenuation。\",\"effect_estimate\":\"cluster-based permutation P=0.002（正文对该对比报告）；未提供各频带独立效应量/CI。\",\"statistical_unit_and_method\":\"患者/半球级时频分析；5000次cluster-based permutation；Pre Reg-Turn来自无冻结转弯前3秒。\",\"risk_of_bias\":{\"tool_or_framework\":\"adapted_not_validated\",\"domains\":[{\"domain\":\"样本选择\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns\",\"reason\":\"单中心13例DBS definite-FoG；无non-freezer。\",\"source_locator\":\"p2-3\"},{\"domain\":\"行为标签\",\"judgement\":\"some_concerns